  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Dies irae (2021), published by Leuven University Press, has no recorded citations yet, but it has been downloaded 1,614 times.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Dies irae by Pieter Berg\u00e9 was published by Leuven University Press in 2021. Conceptually, the work connects to Art, Humanities, Theology and Philosophy.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It has been downloaded 1,614 times via OAPEN.</p>",
